### Create Lion
POST http://localhost:8080/members/lions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "이영희",
  "major": "컴퓨터공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "roleName": "아기사자",
  "studentId": "20230002"
}



### Create Staff
POST http://localhost:8080/members/staffs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "박민수",
  "major": "소프트웨어학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "position": "부대표"
}

### Find Lion
GET http://localhost:8080/members/이영희

### Find Staff
GET http://localhost:8080/members/박민수

### Update Lion
PUT http://localhost:8080/members/lions/이영희
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "major": "소프트웨어학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "Frontend",
  "studentId": "20245678"
}

### Update Staff
PUT http://localhost:8080/members/staffs/박민수
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "major": "소프트웨어학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "position": "부대표"
